    <string name="local_model_howto">Install on iQOO 15</string>
    <string name="local_model_howto_body">Edge Gallery cannot share its private copy with this app. Downloading Gemma there does not install it here.\n\n1. In this app: System → Download Gemma 3 1B (.task), Gemma 4 E4B GPU (~3 GB), or full Gemma 4 E4B (~3.7 GB).\n2. Or export/share a model file into Downloads, then Import.\n3. Optional: download Whisper Tiny, then enable Ollama translation for non-English voice.\n4. Turn on agent skills for Wikipedia / hash / email / kitchen adventure.\n5. Turn on “Use local model when available”, then open Ask SMRITI.\n\nAsk still works with rules if no model is installed. Never rely on the model for leak confirmation.</string>
